WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.511
Theo: What are we going to do?

2
00:00:06.512 --> 00:00:09.645
Kelli: We better call the fire department.

3
00:00:09.646 --> 00:00:12.054
Ben: They have tall ladders.

4
00:00:12.055 --> 00:00:17.497
Skyler: They can rescue Whiskers.

5
00:00:17.498 --> 00:00:20.872
Riley: I'll run home and call right away.

6
00:00:20.873 --> 00:00:24.046
Theo: Whiskers, don't let go!

7
00:00:24.047 --> 00:00:26.118
Sarah: He looks scared.

8
00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:32.987
Theo: Hurry, Riley! Whiskers can't hold on much longer!

9
00:00:32.988 --> 00:00:37.429
Riley: Mom, we have to call the fire department!

10
00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:40.577
Mrs. Summers: What? There's a fire?

11
00:00:40.578 --> 00:00:45.871
Riley: No. Whiskers is stuck on Theo's roof.

12
00:00:45.872 --> 00:00:48.004
Mrs. Summers: Oh dear.

13
00:00:48.005 --> 00:00:52.162
Riley: We're afraid Whiskers will fall!

14
00:00:52.163 --> 00:00:54.263
Mrs. Summers: I'll call right now.

15
00:00:54.264 --> 00:00:57.959
You go wait for the fire truck.

16
00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:01.200
Riley: My mom called the fire department.

17
00:01:01.201 --> 00:01:04.883
Sarah: Look, Chatter is flying up to Whiskers!

18
00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:09.486
Skyler: Aw! He's keeping Whiskers company!

19
00:01:09.487 --> 00:01:12.703
Sarah: Here comes Riley's mom.

20
00:01:12.704 --> 00:01:15.315
Mrs. Summers: The fire truck should be here soon.

21
00:01:15.316 --> 00:01:16.884
Theo: I hope so.

22
00:01:16.885 --> 00:01:21.993
Whiskers is getting tired!

23
00:01:21.994 --> 00:01:26.170
Sarah: Be brave, Whiskers!

24
00:01:26.171 --> 00:01:28.791
Riley: I hear the fire truck now.

25
00:01:28.792 --> 00:01:32.515
Ben: Here it comes!

26
00:01:32.516 --> 00:01:35.567
Firefighter 1: We got a call about a hamster.

27
00:01:35.568 --> 00:01:38.800
Theo: There he is, on my roof!

28
00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:41.479
Kelli: And we're locked out of the house.

29
00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:43.300
Firefighter 2: Get the tall ladder.

30
00:01:43.301 --> 00:01:46.600
We'll need a net too!

31
00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:49.902
Theo: It looks like Whiskers is going to fall!

32
00:01:49.903 --> 00:01:52.189
Ben: Hang on, Whiskers!

33
00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:55.440
Chatter: Hang on! Hang on!

34
00:01:55.441 --> 00:01:58.729
Sarah: Don't let go now!

35
00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:01.805
Firefighter 1: Get the net under him, fast!

36
00:02:01.806 --> 00:02:07.868
He's about to fall!

